1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,583
The lake is still before the day begins. A quiet morning gives us room to notice details that disappear when we rush.

2
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,666
Water gathers into a bright curtain and falls into the green pool. The surrounding forest holds the cool shade of the afternoon.

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:38,474
Across the dunes, wind leaves curved lines in the sand. These patterns remind us that a landscape can change without anyone being there.

4
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,974
Along the narrow path, light arrives in small pieces. Slowing down makes the space between the trees feel much larger.

5
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:07,823
Evening spreads warm color across the flowers. A single tree marks the horizon while the last sunlight rests on the field.

6
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:22,854
Green light hangs above the dark coast. Under a sky this wide, the small concerns of the day begin to feel more distant.
